<BaseLayout title="Customer Moments | Vincenzo's Fish & Chips Van" description="Real customer moments and community support for Vincenzo's Fish & Chips Van.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">Our customers</div><h1 class="page-title">Big smiles. Long queues.</h1><p class="lead">We will never invent reviews or customer photographs. These are real moments from the road.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container grid-2 moments"><img src="/assets/images/press/van-queue.jpg" alt="A real customer queue at the little black van"><div><div class="kicker">Our promise</div><h2 class="section-title">If you are in the queue, we will serve you.</h2><p class="lead">Thank you to every customer who travels, waits, shares our posts and welcomes the little black van into their community.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button button-red" href="https://www.facebook.com/VincenzosFishAndChipsVan/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See customer comments</a></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.moments{align-items:center}.moments img{width:100%;height:520px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:28px}</style>
